<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEP" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Sofoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sofoni Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sofoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sof</para>
  <para style="mt1">Sofoni</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">GALA gooiti Sofoni ti woni, naati ka ti sɛʋɛi nii zu. Sofoni ɠɛni ga masagi Ezekiase vofodai ta. É GALA gooi woni masagi Zoziase ná-masadai ma ziɛgi zu, kona undɔzita puunaanigɔiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ta undɔzita taaʋuugɔi (640-609), aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ. Naama ziɛgi zu nɔ ɠa Zelemini ta Naɠuume ti ta-eteai ziɛni la. Naa ɠɛɛni ɓalaa aisa Asiili yooi ʋa zo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEP 2:13">2:13</ref></char>). Sofoni ná-keela wooi ɠɛni liizu Zuda yooi ʋɔ, naazu Izilayɛle yooi ɓegai ma ga zo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sofoni ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu é lo tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi ʋa é ʋaazu, yeeɠɛɠalai GALA ge ʋaazu faa zeizu la Zuda ta zɔɔma yooiti ma, ti eteai zu ná pɛ. Naama vaa zeimai ɠa ʋaazu nuɓusɛiti ɲadesu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEP 3:9">3:9</ref></char>), ta GALA ka ʋaazu nuɓusɛi ɠilazuʋɛ zei ʋele ɓɛtɛzu ʋolu ga niina, niiti ti ga ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti ta tuʋa ʋele ʋagɔ nuiti.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Sofoni lɛɛ vai (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEP 1:1">1:1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. GALA ka ʋaazu faa zeizu Zuda ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEP 1:2-2:3">1:2—2:3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. GALA ka ʋaazu faa zeizu eteai zu yooi zɔiti ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEP 2:4-15">2:4-15</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. GALA ka ʋaazu nuɓusɛi ɠilazuʋɛ zei ʋele ɓɛtɛzu ʋolu ga niina, niiti ta yɛ ga ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti ta tuʋa ʋele ʋagɔ nuiti (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEP 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEP 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:1"/>Wooi niiti ka Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti woni Sofoni ma, Zuda masagi Zoziase, Amon ná-doun zunui, ná-yeeɠɛɠalai zu. Sofoni ɠɛni ga Kusi ná-doun zunui, naa kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛ ga Gedalia, naa kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛ ga Amalia, naa kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛ ga Ezekiase.<verse eid="ZEP 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eteai pɛ tukpɔɠaaleʋe vai</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:2">«Nà ʋaazu anii kpein suwuɠaaleʋezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:2">niiti ti yɛnvuzu eteai zu.<verse eid="ZEP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:3"/>Nà nuɓusɛi pɛ koloɠolosu ta suaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:3">gè wɔniiti pɛ koloɠolo ta kaleiti pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:3">gè naa ɠoloɠolo, nii é nu ɲɔiti kɔɠɔziɠazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:3">Nà nu vului ma zuwu ɠaaleʋezu eteai zu,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:3">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEP 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fai é kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ nuiti daalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:4"/>«Nà yeewuzeɠezu Zuda nuɓusɛiti daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:4">Zeluzalɛme nuiti kpein daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:4">gè Ɓaale lɛbi nui mɔtaiti pɛ suwuɠaaleʋe adaʋɛ tɔna ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:4">ta zɔiti ti botii ɠɛɛzu bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:4">ti pɛ ʋɔɔma ta zalaɠa ɠula nuiti.<verse eid="ZEP 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:5"/>Nà naati pɛ koloɠolo, niiti ti lɛɛzu pɛlɛ ɠɔmaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:5">ti ɗa nɔkɔ ná aniiti pɛ bu, ti volozu geeɠɔlɔgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:5">ta zɔiti ti nɔkɔsu bù, ti ɗa ɠona mà, nɛ̀i gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:5">ti lati ti ɗa minazeɠegiti bo ta-ɠalagi Mɔlɔke ʋɛ.<verse eid="ZEP 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:6"/>Nà naati koloɠolo, zɔiti ti ʋoluavegai bà, nɛ̀i gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:6">ta zɔiti ti la gàiziɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:6">ti la wɔinni ti ʋa nà-kpɔba zɔlɔɔ, ɓaa ti ʋa gàazaɠa.»<verse eid="ZEP 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fai é nu wolaiti daalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:7"/>À maaɠɛ kpɔ, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:7">mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-foloi maaɓuɠaa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:7">Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zalaɠai ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:7">é naati gba, zɔiti é ti loligai.<verse eid="ZEP 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛ ma: «Tama, nà-zalaɠa ɠula voloi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:8">nà laalɛ kundiɠiiti bu, ta masa dointi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:8">ta niiti kpein ti wɛɛinti ta-maaɠilii ma zii wosu.<verse eid="ZEP 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:9"/>Naama volo ná, nà vɔɔɠu naati ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:9">zɔiti ti ɓudɛzu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɓofalagi maazu, eɠɛ zii ɠiligiti,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">zɔiti ti ɓudɛzu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɓofalagi maazu, eɠɛ zii ɠiligiti</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: <char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 5:5">1Sa 5:5</ref></char>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:9">ti ti-maliɠii ná-pɛlɛi wuulaave ga naavoloi, sɔlɔɔgai toomai zu ta yaavai.»<verse eid="ZEP 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fai é wosu yaaɠoiti daalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:10"/>«Tama, naama volo ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:10">ta kpee woo wolai mɛni Kale Ziɠidaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:10">ta zɔngɔ wooi Koi Niinɛi zu ʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:10">ta ani ɠolo lu golai gizeiti ma,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:10">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEP 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:11"/>«À kpeei loo, Buu Ʋele Ɠoizu nuiti,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Buu Ʋele Ɠoizu nuiti</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Koda Ɠoizu nuiti</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:11">mazɔlɔɔ yaaɠoiti pɛ ta zaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:11">wali ɠaiziɛ nuiti pɛ ti zuwuɠaa ɠa leʋezu.»<verse eid="ZEP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fai é wosu kibɔɔlɔma nuiti daalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:12"/>«Naa zu, nà Zeluzalɛme zuvɛɠɛlɛfɛɠɛlɛ ga fitinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:12">nà vɔɔɠu zunuiti pɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:12">ti zeini su kpɛ, eɠɛ dɔɔi buuʋɛai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:12">ti ɗa bo yiimaʋɛ ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:12">‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la faa nɔpɛ kɛa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:12">ma ʋagɔ ɓaa ma ɲɔu!›<verse eid="ZEP 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:13"/>Toosui ɠa wo ga ta-naavoloiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:13">ta-ʋɛlɛiti ta ɠoloɠolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:13">Ta pɛlɛiti to, kɛlɛ ti la ɲia ti wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:13">ti leezɛn ɓeleiti da, kɛlɛ ti la ma lɔɔi ta ɓɔlea.»<verse eid="ZEP 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-foloi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-folo wolai maaɓuɠaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:14">maaɓuɠaa, gaazuvilɛʋɛ é ɗa ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:14">kpee ɲɔi ɠa é loozu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-foloi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:14">salaʋusui ziilogai ti pɛ ba, naa ɓɔɠɔi ɠa kpee wolai loo.<verse eid="ZEP 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:15"/>Toɠa ɠɛ ga ziiɠaawana voloi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:15">kidaaʋili foloi ta koozuʋiligi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:15">faa zuɠoloɠolo foloi ta faaɠaaʋalabai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:15">Foloi naa ɠa ɠɛ ga kpidii, é ɠɛ ga kpidi ɓɔii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:15">foloi naa ɠa ɠɛ ga tonaɓiingi ta ɓumugi.<verse eid="ZEP 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:16"/>Naama volo ná, salaʋusuiti ta puʋugi vɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:16">ti kɔɔ ɓeei loo taa wolaiti daalɔɠɔma siɠigi ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:16">ta ti zu ʋɛlɛ ɠaaɠoozagiti daalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="ZEP 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:17"/>«Nà nuɓusɛiti dɔ kidaaʋiligi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:17">ta ziɛ eɠɛ gaazuɠole nuiti, ti ɗa yeeʋɛɛ mɛmɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:17">mazɔlɔɔ ti kotoi ɠɛa dàalɔɠɔma, nɛ̀i gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:17">Ti-ma ɲamai ɠa ʋu adaʋɛ pɛ eɠɛ fufiligi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:17">ti-ma ʋoomaiti ta luula eɠɛ kaʋai.»<verse eid="ZEP 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:18"/>Ta-waliiti ta zanugi ti ti ya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:18">naati ti la zooga ti ʋa ti ɠizo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:18">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-ziiɠaawana voloi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:18">Ná-ziiɠaawana abui ɠa eteai pɛ koloɠolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:18">Gaamazu, naa maa ɠa yiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 1:18">toɠa eteai zu nuɓusɛiti pɛ suwuɠaaleʋe.<verse eid="ZEP 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEP 2"/>
  <para style="s">Toligi é wosu ɓɔɠɔmaayei vai zu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:1"/>À ɠaalɛ ba, wo maaɓɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:1">wɔi wo ga zii, unfe ge la wo ma,<verse eid="ZEP 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:2"/>aisa deve zɛʋɛi ʋa ɠula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:2">foloi ʋa leʋe eɠɛ molo ɓooloi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:2">aisa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-ziiɠaawana ʋa zeeli wo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:2">aisa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-ziiɠaawana voloi ʋa zeeli!<verse eid="ZEP 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:3"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaiziɛ, wɔi wo ga ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti zooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:3">wo ɠolozu ná-deveiti bɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:3">À telebodai ɠaiziɛ ta ɓɔɠɔmaayeii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:3">Tanisu toɠa wo yɛ ná Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-ziiɠaawana voloi.<verse eid="ZEP 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nimizai ɠa folo liizu ʋele nuiti tuɠɔ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:4"/>Kulaai ɠa wo Gaza ʋa tɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:4">Asekalɔn ɠoloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:4">Asadɔde nuiti ti ɓɛ ná, ga folo gaalɔgai kpekpe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:4">Ekelɔn nuiti ti ɠula ná ʋa.<verse eid="ZEP 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:5"/>Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ, Kelɛte nuiti, kpoloɗɛi ɠoba zei wo nuiti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:5">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tukpɔi ɠa wo laalɔɠɔma, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:5">«Kanaan, é ga Filisiti nuiti ta-yooi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:5">nà è ɠoloɠolosu, nu vulu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛa ná.<verse eid="ZEP 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:6"/>Ɗa-yooi, kpoloɗɛi laaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:6">miná ɠa valibo ga togani laamiizuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:6">zooi baala makɛ nuiti ta ɠɛ ɓizɛzu su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:6">ti ɗa baalagiti ta-zasai lo ná.»<verse eid="ZEP 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:7"/>Kpoloɗɛi laaʋɛ tɔna ka ɠɛ ga Zuda nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti tɔnɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:7">Ta ɠɛ liizu ga ta-loganiiti ná, ti ɗa laami.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:7">Kpɔkɔi, ti ɗa looɠo Asekalɔn ʋɛlɛiti bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:7">mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ta-ƓALAGI ɠa ti maalobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:7">é ta-vai valibo ga pagɔ.<verse eid="ZEP 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nimizai ɠa folo ɠulazu ʋele nuiti tuɠɔ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:8"/>«Gè Moaɓe nuiti ta-ʋoomu gooiti mɛnini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:8">ta woo ɲɔi Amɔn nuiti ti boni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:8">ti ɓaaɠulani nà-nuɓusɛiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:8">ti ɗa ta-yooi zuwɔɔlɔ ga naati ta-yooi, ti ɠɛni seɠezu.<verse eid="ZEP 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:9"/>Naa ɠa é ba, eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:9">Moaɓe ɠa ɠɛ ga Sɔdɔme ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:9">Amɔn nuiti ti ɠɛ ga Gomɔɔl ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:9">tufa ɲɔi letele nɔ ɠa a ɠɛ ʋɔnɔsu náʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:9">kpolo ɠula yeɠei nɔ ɠɛ ná, zooi ɠoloɠolo mɛtu eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:9">Nà-nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti ta loo ti zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:9">nà-zooi zu nuiti ta yɛ ná, naati ta naa zeɠe ga tɔnɔ,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:9">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEP 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:10"/>Naa ɠa zeelizu ti ma ga ta-wasogi ma zalai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:10">tɔɔzei ti ɓaaɠulani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, ná-nuɓusɛiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:10">ti ta-vaiti gaawɔɔlɔ, naati ti loo bu.<verse eid="ZEP 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ná-maayikii lɛ ga tiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:11">mazɔlɔɔ toɠa eteai ná-galagiti kpein koloɠolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:11">Naazu, anɛɛ zii niiti ti maaɠoozaai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:11">ti pɛ ta lɛbiyai ve bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:11">ɛsɛ gilagilagi ɠa naa ɠɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi zeizuʋɛ.<verse eid="ZEP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nimizai ɠa lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu yeezazuʋɛ nuiti tuɠɔ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:12"/>Etiyopi nuɓusɛiti ɓalaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:12">nà-boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠa ti zuɓota.<verse eid="ZEP 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nimizai ɠa lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ nuiti tuɠɔ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa yeewuzeɠe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:13">nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋele yooi laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:13">toɠa Asiili undaaʋili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:13">é Ninive ɠoloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:13">naa ɠɛ ga zou vɔɔi eɠɛ teʋebai.<verse eid="ZEP 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:14"/>Taai ʋuuzuʋɛ ɠa, toganiiti ta ɠɛ ʋɛɛzu ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:14">ta suai ma ziiti kpein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:14">buungiti ta dɛvɛiti ta ɠɛ zɛlɛsu ma ɓɛdɛgiti ba kpidii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:14">Nu ɗa wɔniiti goomɛni pɛlɛiti ma venɛtɛlɛiti da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:14">nu ɠa yɛsu kpofalagi nɔ ma, è pɛlɛi wuuɠoloɠologai ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:14">sɛdele dakaiti ta ɠula ná.<verse eid="ZEP 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:15"/>Wɛlɛ lɛɛ taa wolai ʋa, koozunɛɛi ɠɛni su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:15">su nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛni kaazu ga ta zeini ziilɛigi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:15">ti ɗa ɠisiɛ ga ti ɠɛɠala la ná.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:15">É woloa, é ɠɛa ga dɔɓɔ zuaiti pɛɛzuʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:15">Zɔiti dɔin ti leʋesu ná</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 2:15">ta foei vɛɛzu, ti yeeʋɛɛ la.<verse eid="ZEP 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEP 3"/>
  <para style="s">Nimizai ɠa Zeluzalɛme nuiti tuɠɔ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:1"/>Nimizai ɠa kololala laai ʋɛ, kɔzɔai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:1">é ga nu ʋaa laai!<verse eid="ZEP 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:2"/>É la woiloni toligi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:2">é la vaazu maaɠoloi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:2">é la ɓɔɠɔ ɠalivaazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:2">é la ʋoluzeizu ná-GALAGI ʋa.<verse eid="ZEP 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:3"/>Ná-kundiɠiiti ti ná</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:3">ta ga zalaiti ti zikɔzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:3">ná-tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ta ga zuluɓuiti ti kpɛgi wosu kpidii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:3">ti la tanɔpɛ makɛsu, ti ʋa mi sobui.<verse eid="ZEP 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:4"/>Ta-ƓALA goo wo nuiti ti la ga totuɠɔ ʋagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:4">ta ga yaava nuiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:4">Ta-zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti la unfema veezu aniiti bɛ ti veai GALA bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:4">ta ná-tɔgiti koloɠolosu.<verse eid="ZEP 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:5"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ná, taazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:5">é ɗa ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga telebo nu ʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:5">é la faa ɲɔu nɔpɛ kɛɛzu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:5">Sobu-o-sobu, zeɠema la ba, toɠa ná-tukpɔiti gaaleʋezu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:5">Kɛlɛ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui la ɗa ga unfe pɛ.<verse eid="ZEP 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:6"/>«Gè ziiti suwuɠaaleʋea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:6">gè ti-velesuʋɛti suɠoloɠolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:6">Gè koi yɔɠɔzuʋɛti koloɠologa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:6">nu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ziɛzu náti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:6">Ta-laa wolaiti suɲakai ɠɛ de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:6">nu ɠila kpalaa ge la mɔ zeini ná.<verse eid="ZEP 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:7"/>Kɛlɛ gè ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:7">‹Ɗa unfe mà, è tɛnɛ gooi zo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:7">naa ɠa a kɛ, è-zeizuʋɛ mina ɠoloɠolo.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:7">Gè ti loɠani siɛ mɔinmɔin su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:7">kɛlɛ ti ɠɛni ɠaazuvilɛzu ga faa ɲɔi ɠɛa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:7">ti-ɠɛɛ vai pɛ su.<verse eid="ZEP 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:8"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à màaɓɔun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:8">ungo, à naama voloi maaɓɔun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:8">yeei gè ʋaazu wuzeɠezu la kɔɔzoganii vaa zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:8">Gè devea ga gè ziiti ta masadaiti gaalɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:8">ga gè nà-ziiɠaawana wolai zei ti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:8">Eteai pɛ ka ɠala ga nà-ziiɠaawana abui,» Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEP 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minazeɠegi Siyɔn ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:9"/>«Naazu nà nuɓusɛiti maavalibo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:9">nà ti-lakɔlɔgiti ɲade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:9">ta fàli, nɛ̀i gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:9">ti pɛ ta dɛ̀bi ga yiimaʋɛ pɛ.<verse eid="ZEP 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:10"/>Anɛɛ Etiyopi ɗɛ wolai ʋoluʋele nuu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:10">dɛ̀bi nui, niiti gè ti vazani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:10">ta ʋa pɔ̀ ga ta-vebɛaniiti.<verse eid="ZEP 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:11"/>«Naama volo ná, nà-nuɓusɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:11">wo la mɔ unfega ga wo luʋa ʋeleiti faa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:11">kotoi niiti wo ti ɠɛɛni dàalɔɠɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:11">Nà naati pɛ kula wo zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:11">zɔiti ti laavegai ga wasogi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:11">wa ɓe niina waso fai ʋa nà-gize ɲadegai ma.<verse eid="ZEP 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:12"/>Nà nuɓusɛiti makɛ wo zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:12">ti ga ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti ta ti ʋalagai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:12">ta ɠɛ velesu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋolu.<verse eid="ZEP 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:13"/>Izilayɛle nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti ta ɠɛ vulua,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:13">ti la mɔ telebotala vaa nɔpɛ kɛa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:13">ti la mɔ zɛɛ nɔpɛ boga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:13">ti la mɔ yaava vaa nɔpɛ kɛa ga ti-laaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:13">Ta zoo ti daami wo, ti ɲiimɛni ʋagɔi wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:13">nu nɔpɛ ge la ti maalua.»<verse eid="ZEP 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:14"/>Ee, Siyɔn nuɓusɛiti, à vuka ga koozunɛɛi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:14">Ee, Izilayɛle nuiti, à ɠɔkɔ ga koozunɛɛi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:14">Ee, Zeluzalɛme nuɓusɛiti, à ɠoozunɛ ga wo-yiimaʋɛ pɛ!<verse eid="ZEP 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:15"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI peelala vai ma ɠasɔi zeɠea wo unma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:15">é wo zili nuiti kpɛa wo ʋolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:15">Izilayɛle ná-masagi, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa wo zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:15">maa la mɔ nɛɛni wo ʋa lua maanɔɠɔ ʋa.<verse eid="ZEP 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:16"/>Naama volo ná, ta ɠɛ Zeluzalɛme ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:16">«À mina lua, Siyɔn nuɓusɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:16">wo iɲɔ ge mina leʋe pa!<verse eid="ZEP 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:17"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wa-ƓALAGI ɠa wo zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:17">ga kɔɔɠɔ ɠuluɓai é wo ɠizosu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:17">Toɠa wo ɠaanɛɛnɛzu ga ná-nɛɛbɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:17">toɠa koozunɛ wuyei loo wa-vaa zu.»<verse eid="ZEP 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:18"/>Maliɠii ɠɛ ma: «Nà maanɔɠɔ vaiti kpe wa-vɛti voloiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:18">niiti ti ɠɛa wo unma ga kasɔi ta zelilomai.<verse eid="ZEP 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:19"/>Wɛlɛ, naama ziɛgi zu, nà vɔɔɠu naati pɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:19">niiti ti wo zopele ɲɔuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:19">Nà naati balo, niiti ti lɛkpuzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:19">zɔiti ti loai ya, gè naati gaalɛ ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:19">Nà wo ɠɛ ga unfema nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:19">wo-lɔɠɔi ɠula zooiti pɛ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:19">ʋɛti unfegi zeelini wo ma náti.<verse eid="ZEP 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:20"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, nà ʋa ga woye ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:20">siɛgi zu gè wo ɠaalɛɛzu ba la ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:20">nà wo-laaseigi wɔɔlɔ, lɛbiyai ɠɛ wo ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:20">eteai zu nuɓusɛiti pɛ saama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:20">Nà naa ɠɛ siɛgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:20">gè wa-vaiti maavalibosu da, wa ɓɔɠɔi wo ɠaazu.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEP 3:20">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é boga.<verse eid="ZEP 3:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 3"/>
</usx>
